  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sustainable Public Procurement (SPP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed goal of the SPP portfolio is to improve service delivery for economic, human health and wellbeing, social development, and environmental sustainability in Tanzania. The portfolio will also support the implementation and monitoring of Sustainable Public Procurement related policies, strategies and guidelines for Tanzania. It will capacitate oversight institutions mandated with implementation and execution of Sustainable Public Procurement for the people and government of Tanzania. It</narrative>
  </description>
